<title>USA: Andover, Minn., won by FBS.</title>
<headline>Andover, Minn., won by FBS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>FBS Investment Svcs. said it won $3.120 million of Andover, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds of 1997, Series A, with a net interest cost of 4..870 percent.</p>
</text>
